From 2ae7fac9c1b422f5f99fd52874d8b8106864f27a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Miroslav=20Mr=C3=A1z?= <miroslav.mraz@techmania.cz>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 05:01:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH v1 5/5] media: i2c: gc5035: modernise and add Galaxy A52
 (a52q) support
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bring the carried-over GC5035 driver up to the current V4L2 sub-device
API and add what the Samsung Galaxy A52 4G (a52q, SM7125) needs for its
macro and depth cameras:

 - switch the pad ops to the subdev active state (v4l2_subdev_state,
   init_state/internal_ops) and the modern probe API (probe, void
   remove, v4l2_async_register_subdev_sensor), arming runtime PM before
   the subdev is registered;
 - parse fwnode device properties (orientation, rotation) and expose
   V4L2_SEL_TGT_CROP / NATIVE_SIZE through get_selection;
 - replace the separate analogue/digital gain controls with a single
   V4L2_CID_ANALOGUE_GAIN mapped through an analogue-step LUT plus a
   fine pre-gain, matching the vendor gain split;
 - make the pwdn GPIO optional and honour a DT "label" so boards with
   more than one GC5035 (a52q has two) get distinct entity names for
   per-module tuning;
 - correct the analog supply name to avdd28 to match the binding.

Update Kconfig for the current VIDEO_DEV symbol and use
MODULE_LICENSE("GPL").

Signed-off-by: Miroslav Mráz <miroslav.mraz@techmania.cz>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/Kconfig  |   2 +-
 drivers/media/i2c/gc5035.c | 210 ++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------
 2 files changed, 137 insertions(+), 75 deletions(-)

